    - KIRAN 1800-599-0019
    - Vandrevala 9999 666 555
    - Women 181
    - Childline 1098
verified_note: 'Owner confirmed 2026-07-25: national emergency numbers are standardised and stable. NOTE
  the volatile ones are the CRISIS lines, not these — US 988 launched 2022, CA 988 launched Nov 2023,
  Tele-MANAS is newer still. Re-check crisis_by_country periodically; emergency_by_country effectively
  never moves.'
